WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:03.630
- You have the most like
comfortable relationship ever.

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:04.463
I love it.

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:05.370
How did y'all meet?

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.860
- Dave and I, well, we met at Mardi Gras,

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.160
which is its own story.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.940
You can Google it.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.749
- Beads were involved possibly.

00:00:13.749 --> 00:00:14.733
- Yes.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.690
But we realized, you know, we
met through a mutual friend,

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.098
my friend Jules, who was
in the cover band with me.

00:00:21.098 --> 00:00:21.931
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:21.931 --> 00:00:26.430
- And we realized after we had
been dating for quite a while

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.080
we were kind of trying
to do the math on like,

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.060
when you're introduced
from a mutual friend,

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.728
you're kinda like, we
must have met before.

00:00:32.728 --> 00:00:34.710
- Both been at the same
place or something.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.543
- Right.

00:00:35.543 --> 00:00:36.376
Like this friend of mine

00:00:36.376 --> 00:00:38.220
used to have an annual
Halloween party every year.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.300
It was like a big thing

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.550
and everyone she knew
came to it every year.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.470
So, that was us kind of sitting and going.

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:44.303
Like, I was like, "Well,

00:00:44.303 --> 00:00:45.600
you must have been at
Jules's Halloween party."

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.700
And he's like, "Definitely,
I went many times."

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:52.050
So now we start playing like
Halloween costume roulette

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.660
of like, I'm like, do you
remember when we were,

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.070
yeah, synchronized swimmers?

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:56.903
No.

00:00:56.903 --> 00:00:59.850
I'm like, how about when
we were California raisins.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.470
Nobody knew what we were.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.680
And everybody spent the night
putting out different guesses

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.660
for what the costume was.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:10.290
But so, to show people, to demonstrate.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.690
We spent the whole night
gathering in little groups

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:15.000
and singing "I Heard it
Through the Grapevine"

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.920
and he was like, "Yes, I do remember that!

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.330
I was at the party dressed as,

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:20.010
me and my friend were Mario and Luigi."

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.259
And I was like, "I don't
remember that at all.

00:01:22.259 --> 00:01:23.092
You don't exist to me."

00:01:23.092 --> 00:01:23.940
- You were not memorable.

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:28.410
- So then we go back, I
find on an old computer,

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.210
a video from that night

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.897
of me and three of my friends singing

00:01:31.897 --> 00:01:33.540
"I Heard it Through the Grapevine."

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.035
And it's tight on us.

00:01:35.035 --> 00:01:37.950
Who is in the back corner of the video

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.040
but Mario and Luigi.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.880
The cutest Mario I've ever seen seen.

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:45.713
- Isn't that weird?

00:01:45.713 --> 00:01:46.773
That's a movie.

